# steps/named-struct-exec.md §12: a statement in the body of a nested named Structure -- no unit child, so
# no procedure of its own yet (a later step) -- is refused where it stands, in its own words.  It had no
# row before.
Outer:
    size_t: a 0U
    (): Inner
        size_t: b 0U
        b: b + 1U
    end: Inner
return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
